{"name": "La Jade", "name_en": "La Jade", "district": "长宁区", "address": "上海市长宁区延安西路488号城中希尔顿酒店3楼", "price_avg": 2000, "price_range": "套餐制(无固定菜单，主厨Cielo按食材发办)", "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "融合菜"], ["西餐", "融合菜"]], "form": "私宴会所", "signature_dishes": ["蛙腿risotto式炖饭", "宁波发酵物配伊比利亚黑猪", "新疆沙棘配法国龙蒿", "酱油菱角蒙布朗"], "phone_raw": "0215317091253", "booking_method": "微信预约(WeChat: 15317091253)，invite-only，开六个月仍一席难求", "status": "open", "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "price_sources": [{"platform": "携程笔记(人均2000+)", "value": 2000, "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=125613594"}], "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "藏在城中希尔顿酒店3楼的La Jade，最早知道它是因为看到有人吐槽说不提供餐前面包套餐还卖那么贵的评论，但是我这套菜单吃完，真是有点撑到，且给人一种饱满而愉悦的回味。酱油菱角蒙布朗绝了。", "source": "携程笔记", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=125613594", "date": "2025-02-26"}, {"quote": "Even six months since opening, La Jade at the Hilton Shanghai City Center remains one of the toughest reservations in town. This exclusive, invite-only chef's table has ignited an underground war among Shanghai's food connoisseurs. There's no fixed menu here. Head chef Cielo presents frog meat minced to mirror grains of risotto rice, paired with sweet peas and finger lime.", "source": "TimeOut Shanghai", "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html", "date": "2025-03-26"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "携程笔记", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=125613594"}], "negative_signals": ["不提供餐前面包被吐槽性价比争议", "酒店内空间非纯楼中私宴，私宴属性偏chef's table", "invite-only门槛高"], "soft_ad_flags": ["界面新闻/今日头条冬日菜单报道偏品牌稿"], "traffic_signals": ["开业六个月仍一席难求", "上海美食圈地下war"]}, "sources": [{"title": "TimeOut Shanghai-8 Eateries Reservations Necessary", "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html", "type": "media"}, {"title": "携程笔记-La Jade法餐2000+", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=125613594", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "界面新闻-LA JADE创意融合料理冬日菜单", "url": "http://m.toutiao.com/group/7451446826890281481/", "type": "media"}], "scores": {"objective": 72, "diner": 75, "taste": 82, "endorsement": 78, "soft_ad_penalty": 3, "platform_credibility": 0.85}, "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "notes": "由『上海 chef's table 预约 隐藏』在TimeOut EN捞出。酒店内chef's table，invite-only无菜单。坐标留空待补。"}
{"name": "RONG融", "name_en": "RONG", "district": "徐汇区", "address": "上海市徐汇区岳阳路(近建国西路，窗面建国西路绿荫，精确门牌预约告知)", "price_avg": 980, "price_range": "板前套餐(价格待确认，参考同档约800-1200)", "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "融合菜"], ["西餐", "融合菜"]], "form": "私宴会所", "signature_dishes": ["香煎马友鱼配蛤蜊丝瓜风干番茄汁", "鹅肝油条咸蛋黄配大连海胆", "两头乌猪红腐乳低温炭烤", "腌笃鲜灵感汤饭(马蹄笋+潮汕酸菜)"], "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "预约制(Instagram @rongsh221 / 微信)，9座板前，开业仅月余", "status": "open", "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "price_sources": [{"platform": "TastyTrip(开业新店主理人)", "value": 980, "url": "https://www.tastytrip.com/zh-cn/rong-shanghai/"}], "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "这是一家非常小的餐厅，只有九个座位的板前，地址虽是岳阳路，背后明亮的窗户面向建国西路的绿荫。现炸春卷荠菜马蹄牛肉豆干内馅，上面是三种腐乳调成的酱。香煎马友鱼处理非常到位，火候精准，鱼肉干净而有弹性，酱汁以蛤蜊与丝瓜为主体加风干番茄，很可能会成为他们未来的招牌。", "source": "TastyTrip", "url": "https://www.tastytrip.com/zh-cn/rong-shanghai/", "date": "2026-05-10"}, {"quote": "RONG餐厅主厨Benjamin，近三年私厨训练，身上刺了鱼和八爪鱼。他推荐一定要吃油条和新鲜贻贝、自己做的鹌鹑、第三是鸽子。", "source": "抖音(主厨去哪吃)", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7684222536351091968", "date": "2026-09-12"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "TastyTrip(专栏)", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "https://www.tastytrip.com/zh-cn/rong-shanghai/"}], "negative_signals": ["开业仅月余，信息少，平台分缺失", "摆盘被Jocelyn评价为'不是每道菜都非常强烈'", "炭烤力度不足被指出可更大胆"], "soft_ad_flags": ["TastyTrip为骑车主动邀约，非付费但有交情"], "traffic_signals": ["当月已有食客来吃三次", "9座板前需预约"]}, "sources": [{"title": "TastyTrip-上海只有9个座位的小馆RONG", "url": "https://www.tastytrip.com/zh-cn/rong-shanghai/", "type": "media"}, {"title": "TastyTrip EN-RONG 9-Seat Restaurant", "url": "https://www.tastytrip.com/en/rong-shanghai/", "type": "media"}, {"title": "抖音-RONG融主厨Benjamin去哪吃", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7684222536351091968", "type": "ugc"}], "scores": {"objective": 60, "diner": 78, "taste": 78, "endorsement": 65, "soft_ad_penalty": 3, "platform_credibility": 0.75}, "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "notes": "存疑：新开店(2026年4月开业)，精确门牌/电话/价格待真人补。Jocelyn骑车主动邀约。坐标留空。"}
{"name": "Ortensia Shanghai", "name_en": "Ortensia", "district": "静安区", "address": "上海市静安区茂名北路240号张园W14栋(19世纪石库门老宅)", "price_avg": 1688, "price_range": "品鉴套餐1288/1688/2288元三档(+10%服务费)；包厢最低消费午餐4000/晚餐8000", "cuisine_paths": [["西餐", "法餐"], ["中餐", "融合菜"]], "form": "私宴会所", "signature_dishes": ["龙井绿茶烟熏乳鸽", "鱼子酱牛肉塔塔", "时令鱼花胶豌豆蛤蜊清汤", "Ikejime鰤鱼昆布佛手柑"], "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "官网预约(restaurantortensia.com)，每月15号开放下月预订，晚餐订金1000/位，午餐订金300/位，提前1-2周", "status": "open", "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "price_sources": [{"platform": "Rolling Grace/官网", "value": 1688, "url": "https://rollinggrace.com/2026/07/15/ortensia-shanghai/"}], "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "The Longjing Green Tea Smoked Pigeon is the dish that explains the whole project. The breast smoked low and slow under Longjing green tea, the skin crackles delicately, the smoke lingers on the palate for a full minute after the bite is gone. The signature beef tartare with caviar uses Shandong Snow Dragon beef, deliberately tasting like Paris.", "source": "Rolling Grace", "url": "https://rollinggrace.com/2026/07/15/ortensia-shanghai/", "date": "2026-07-15"}, {"quote": "The seasonal fish course: fish maw slow-braised brings luxurious gelatinous body, finished tableside with clear clam bouillon deeply savoury with natural sweetness. The Ikejime sea bream cured in Japanese kombu, bergamot lifts everything with bright aromatic edge almost Earl Grey-like.", "source": "Rolling Grace", "url": "https://rollinggrace.com/2026/07/15/ortensia-shanghai/", "date": "2026-07-15"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "官网/预订制", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "https://www.restaurantortensia.com/shanghai"}], "negative_signals": ["不接受素食/无麸质/无乳糖特殊饮食，48小时前告知", "品鉴套餐固定不可调", " hosted tasting(媒体品鉴)非自费"], "soft_ad_flags": ["Rolling Grace文末注明based on hosted tasting"], "traffic_signals": ["每月15号开放下月预订秒光", "巴黎一星二店", "包厢最低消费8000晚餐"]}, "sources": [{"title": "Rolling Grace-Ortensia Shanghai 6 Stunning Dishes", "url": "https://rollinggrace.com/2026/07/15/ortensia-shanghai/", "type": "media"}, {"title": "Ortensia官网-预订规则", "url": "https://www.restaurantortensia.com/shanghai", "type": "brand_official"}], "scores": {"objective": 75, "diner": 80, "taste": 85, "endorsement": 82, "soft_ad_penalty": 5, "platform_credibility": 0.85}, "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "notes": "巴黎一星Ortensia二店，2024年10月开业，张园石库门。行政主厨Terumitsu Saito(日籍驻巴黎)，上海主厨Hana Zhou。sources仅2类(media+brand)，缺UGC堂食原话，待补。"}
{"name": "鮨琉璃", "name_en": "ITAMOCHI", "district": "长宁区", "address": "上海市长宁区延安西路2088号禧瑞广场1层B125室(夜空花火隔壁)", "price_avg": 980, "price_range": "omakase 980元/位，8席板前，2小时一场", "cuisine_paths": [["亚洲菜", "日料", "寿司"]], "form": "私宴会所", "signature_dishes": ["活龙虾刺身配马粪海胆", "酒蒸澳鲍配春笋酱", "盐麴目光鱼炭烤", "春子鲷寿司", "爱尔兰生蚝寿司"], "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "全预约制，8席板前，根据当日食材定菜单", "status": "open", "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "price_sources": [{"platform": "网易/上海去哪吃", "value": 980, "url": "https://www.163.com/dy/article/JU8J1J8305228HQE.html"}], "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "980元/位，仅设8个板前座位，全预约制。700-800g澳鲍经过5个小时酒蒸，鲍肉肥厚软糯，春笋打成泥加味增做成春笋酱。活北寄贝当面炙烤拌自制芥末味增。9贯寿司用江户前赤醋、琥珀醋、山吹醋三种醋特调。", "source": "网易/上海去哪吃", "url": "https://www.163.com/dy/article/JU8J1J8305228HQE.html", "date": "2025-04-28"}, {"quote": "来自日本的创始人ITAMOCHI先生和习自日本名师的罗师傅一拍即合。进门处是ITAMOCHI亲自设计的日式庭园造景，筷架是自然切割的琉璃，全店木材取自珍贵桧木。", "source": "网易/上海去哪吃", "url": "https://www.163.com/dy/article/JU8J1J8305228HQE.html", "date": "2025-04-28"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "网易探店", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "https://www.163.com/dy/article/JU8J1J8305228HQE.html"}], "negative_signals": ["仅1篇媒体探店，UGC评论样本不足", "2025年4月新店，出品稳定性待观察", "禧瑞广场商场内非纯楼中店"], "soft_ad_flags": ["上海去哪吃公众号推广稿"], "traffic_signals": ["8席全预约制", "古北日料激战区新店"]}, "sources": [{"title": "网易-古北新开板前日料神店鮨琉璃", "url": "https://www.163.com/dy/article/JU8J1J8305228HQE.html", "type": "media"}], "scores": {"objective": 55, "diner": 65, "taste": 75, "endorsement": 55, "soft_ad_penalty": 5, "platform_credibility": 0.7}, "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "notes": "存疑：sources仅1类(media)，无独立UGC堂食原话。古北/延安西路日料板前，ITAMOCHI主理。需真人补大众点评/小红书评价。"}
{"name": "三佰杯", "name_en": "Three Hundred Cups", "district": "静安区", "address": "上海市静安区华山路328号", "price_avg": 200, "price_range": "宁波bistro下酒菜，时令特写板擦写", "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "宁波菜"]], "form": "私宴会所", "signature_dishes": ["酸甜辣胡椒蟹", "醉蟹钳", "糟卤", "宁波呛蟹"], "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "微信小程序'蜗牛预定'预约，不接受walk-in", "status": "open", "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "price_sources": [{"platform": "TimeOut EN", "value": 200, "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html"}], "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "Unlike the refined elegance of most reservations-only restaurants, this Ningbo-style bistro embraces a down-to-earth, bustling street vibe. Expect Zhejiang and Jiangsu-style dishes with elements of Japanese izakaya. A standout dish: the crabs are slightly sweet, sour, spicy and peppery all at once. Specials are scribbled onto and wiped off a board.", "source": "TimeOut Shanghai EN", "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html", "date": "2025-03-26"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "TimeOut(推荐)", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html"}], "negative_signals": ["仅TimeOut一篇英文推荐，缺中文UGC堂食原话", "氛围热闹bistro非纯私宴"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["需微信小程序预约", "时令板擦写菜"]}, "sources": [{"title": "TimeOut EN-8 Eateries Reservations Necessary", "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html", "type": "media"}], "scores": {"objective": 55, "diner": 60, "taste": 72, "endorsement": 60, "soft_ad_penalty": 0, "platform_credibility": 0.7}, "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "notes": "存疑：sources仅TimeOut一篇，diner_quotes仅1条。宁波bistro预约制，需真人补小红书/点评堂食原话。"}
{"name": "2乙酒馆", "name_en": "Alley1293", "district": "长宁区", "address": "上海市长宁区愚园路1293弄小区内(居民楼)", "price_avg": 300, "price_range": "off-menu每日变化，配酒", "cuisine_paths": [["西餐", "融合菜"], ["中餐", "融合菜"]], "form": "私宴会所", "signature_dishes": ["私藏煲仔饭(需报名字)", "Vitello Tonnato小牛肉 tuna酱", "每日off-menu"], "phone_raw": "13166091028", "booking_method": "电话预约13166091028，17:30-00:30周二店休", "status": "open", "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "price_sources": [{"platform": "TimeOut EN/网易", "value": 300, "url": "https://c.m.163.com/news/a/JD106R1R05228HQE.html"}], "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "在愚园路1293弄一个神秘的小酒馆。私藏的煲仔饭要吃这个饭你必须报我名字，后台留言没用。甲Z丙丁的Z，2Z酒馆，打电话。", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7417318994639703308", "date": "2024-09-22"}, {"quote": "主理人就是戏班乐队班主'竹马'，把这里打造成了私密感十足的第三空间。酒至微醺，幸运的客人还能巧遇老板本人的现场即兴solo。Atmospheric dim lighting, off-menu items that change daily. Try Bodega Matador red wine with Vitello Tonnato.", "source": "网易/TimeOut EN", "url": "https://c.m.163.com/news/a/JD106R1R05228HQE.html", "date": "2024-09-26"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "网易/TimeOut", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "https://c.m.163.com/news/a/JD106R1R05228HQE.html"}], "negative_signals": ["居民楼内位置隐蔽", "off-menu每日变化不可预知", "电话预约门槛"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["煲仔饭需报主理人名字", "老板即兴live", "下次有位可能要等数周"]}, "sources": [{"title": "TimeOut EN-2乙 Tavern", "url": "http://www.timeoutshanghai.com/features/Feature/105570/8-Eateries-in-Shanghai-Where-Reservations-Are-Rather-Necessary.html", "type": "media"}, {"title": "网易-魔都9月漂亮饭2乙酒馆", "url": "https://c.m.163.com/news/a/JD106R1R05228HQE.html", "type": "media"}, {"title": "抖音-2乙酒馆文艺小酒馆", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7417318994639703308", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "企查查-东腔西调文化传播(愚园路1293弄2号101)", "url": "https://www.qcc.com/ccomment/a15dbdda9512aa8271f2b38452ab4cd9", "type": "map"}], "scores": {"objective": 65, "diner": 72, "taste": 75, "endorsement": 60, "soft